<rml>
<head>
    <link type="text/rcss" href="/Content/UI/widgets/widgets.rcss"/>
    <link type="text/rcss" href="/Content/UI/demo.rcss"/>
    <style>
        .sfx-panel { width: 320dp; }
        .sfx-grid { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6dp; margin: 6dp 0 8dp 0; }
        .sfx-grid button { box-sizing: border-box; width: 102dp; min-width: 0dp; padding-left: 4dp; padding-right: 4dp; }
        .sfx-grid button.make { border-color: #fbbf2499; color: #fde68a; }
        .sfx-name { font-size: 15dp; color: #fbbf24; margin-top: 8dp; }
        .sfx-line { font-size: 12dp; color: #cbd5e1; word-break: break-word; padding: 6dp 8dp; margin: 4dp 0 4dp 0;
                    background-color: #02040acc; border: 1dp #ffffff1a; border-radius: 6dp; }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="hud" data-model="soundfx">
    <div class="demo-panel sfx-panel">
        <h1>Sound FX</h1>
        <p class="hint">ZzFX sounds are synthesised at run time from a few numbers. Play a preset, or make a new sound.</p>
        <div class="sfx-grid">
            <button data-event-click="play_coin()">Coin</button>
            <button data-event-click="play_laser()">Laser</button>
            <button data-event-click="play_explosion()">Explosion</button>
            <button data-event-click="play_hit()">Hit</button>
            <button data-event-click="play_jump()">Jump</button>
            <button data-event-click="play_blip()">Blip</button>
            <button data-event-click="play_power_up()">Power-up</button>
            <button class="make" data-event-click="randomize()">Randomize</button>
            <button class="make" data-event-click="mutate()">Mutate</button>
        </div>
        <div class="demo-row"><span>Pitch randomness</span><input type="range" min="0" max="0.5" step="0.01" data-value="randomness"/></div>
        <p class="sfx-name">{{name}}</p>
        <p class="sfx-line">{{line}}</p>
        <p class="hint">Paste the line into the editor's sound designer or the ZzFX web designer.</p>
        <div class="demo-row"><span>Music (a song from the music editor)</span><input type="checkbox" data-checked="music"/></div>
    </div>
</body>
</rml>
